  "description": "Amendments to planning permission dated 09 February 2023 (RN: 21/06372/FULL) which itself varied conditions 1, 22, 29 and 30 of planning permission dated 3rd July 2013 (RN: 12/07764/FULL) for the: 'Demolition and rebuilding of rear section of building, excavation to create a two storey basement, extensions and associated refurbishment of Grosvenor Gardens House, to provide 42 residential units (Class C3) on first to seventh floors; reconfiguration at ground floor level to provide mixed retail use (Class A1 and/or Class A3); wellness facility, residential storage, plant, car and cycle parking at basement levels; and public realm works to Eaton Lane (23-47 Grosvenor Gardens and 44-52 Buckingham Palace Road)'. NAMELY, to allow additional fall prevention to Levels 2 and 3; chimney restoration; demolition of maintenance walkway; design development of stone dormers; UKPN door arrangement; alterations to gable end, to dry riser inlets, to bin store door, ventilation grilles, privacy screens, and to escape routes and roof-top services; and omission of cat ladder."
